1
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:38,000
On ancient ground, at the edge of the world, an evil born in
heaven is about to be unleashed on earth.

2
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:10,000
The Prophecy is a action, mystery, fantasy film directed by Gregory Widen.

3
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:42,000
The angel Gabriel comes to Earth to collect a soul which will end the stalemated war
in Heaven, and only a former priest and a little girl can stop him.

4
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:14,000
Gabriel, played by Christopher Walken.

5
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:46,000
Thomas Daggett, played by Elias Koteas.

6
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:18,000
Katherine Henley, played by Virginia Madsen.

7
00:45:44,000 --> 00:45:50,000
Simon, played by Eric Stoltz.

8
00:52:16,000 --> 00:52:22,000
Lucifer, played by Viggo Mortensen.

9
00:58:48,000 --> 00:58:54,000
Rachael, played by Amanda Plummer.

10
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
The Prophecy is a 1995 American fantasy thriller horror film starring Christopher
Walken, Elias Koteas, Virginia Madsen, Eric Stoltz, and Viggo Mortensen.

11
01:11:52,000 --> 01:11:58,000
It was written and directed by Gregory Widen in his feature directorial
debut, and is the first film of The Prophecy series.

12
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
The film tells the story of the Archangel Gabriel (Walken) and his search for an evil soul on Earth, and a
police detective (Koteas) who unknowingly becomes caught in the middle of an angelic civil war.

13
01:24:56,000 --> 01:25:02,000
It was followed by four sequels.

14
01:31:28,000 --> 01:31:34,000
The tone is intense and mind_bending.
